<title>BRAZIL: Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</title>
<headline>Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brazilian Association of Citrus Exporters reported the following output and exports of frozen concentrated orange juice in metric tonnes 66 Brix for November 4 to 10 and the total so far in 1996/97:</p>
<p>		  Nov 4-10     Nov 6-12	  TOTAL	  TOTAL</p>
<p>		    1996	   1995	    1996	   1995</p>
<p>Stocks/open    442,706.4   311,853.6</p>
<p>Production     41,651.7    44,246.0     709,069.9   512,929.6</p>
<p>Shipment	 30,210.5    15,818.4     419,085.6   319,330.5</p>
<p>Home Market	 369.2	 340.9	 5,653.7     7,708.9</p>
<p>Stocks/close   453,778.4   339,940.3</p>
<p>   -- Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
</text>
